# SPA fallback for React Router client-side routing.
# API calls go directly to api.iotaps.com (set via VITE_API_BASE_URL).
#
# NOTE: Cloudflare Pages provides automatic SPA fallback — any request that
# does not match a built static asset is served index.html. A bare
# "/*  /index.html  200" rule is therefore redundant AND is rejected by the
# Pages redirect parser as a self-loop ("Infinite loop detected ... ignored").
# We leave this file rule-free so deep links (/login, /pricing, refreshes)
# work via the built-in fallback with no build warning.
